    "name": "Smoke Break!",
    "steam_appid": 3564090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/7f0fc974d139f87282b8007b3eec0e42.avif?t=1749273403\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span>Smoke Break! is a 3D stealth puzzle game where you play as Applewood, a living puff of smoke, who's hungry for a sweet, charred treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lighthearted adventure, mischief seekers will explore Applewood Factories \u2014 a whimsical pie-producing workshop. Cause hilarious hijinks as you delve deeper into this fantastical factory for a deliciously burnt pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/43a1bb282dc2e6ef9519b06ecba9527f.avif?t=1749273403\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT SMOKE TO GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedy navigation will burn away Applewood's size. Seek out smoke particles scattered around the factory and absorb them to stay puffed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAUSE MISCHIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip through vents, burrow into sacks of flour, and sabotage sweet machinery as you slink your way through pastry-packed corridors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the adorably aggressive bakers as they make every effort to keep you out. If that\u2019s not enough, Gumbo the Janitor\u2014a one-man cleanup crew with a turbo-charged vacuum\u2014has zero tolerance for your smoky shenanigans. Stay sneaky, or it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/7f0fc974d139f87282b8007b3eec0e42.avif?t=1749273403\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span>Smoke Break! is a 3D stealth puzzle game where you play as Applewood, a living puff of smoke, who's hungry for a sweet, charred treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this lighthearted adventure, mischief seekers will explore Applewood Factories \u2014 a whimsical pie-producing workshop. Cause hilarious hijinks as you delve deeper into this fantastical factory for a deliciously burnt pie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/43a1bb282dc2e6ef9519b06ecba9527f.avif?t=1749273403\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT SMOKE TO GROW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedy navigation will burn away Applewood's size. Seek out smoke particles scattered around the factory and absorb them to stay puffed up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/f6a3d6f69ef3dcd5a42ff6317d7cc95d.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAUSE MISCHIEF</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip through vents, burrow into sacks of flour, and sabotage sweet machinery as you slink your way through pastry-packed corridors.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/23fbbd8e6565cce3f42adcf6d4a43f4c.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T GET CAUGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware of the adorably aggressive bakers as they make every effort to keep you out. If that\u2019s not enough, Gumbo the Janitor\u2014a one-man cleanup crew with a turbo-charged vacuum\u2014has zero tolerance for your smoky shenanigans. Stay sneaky, or it\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.poster.avif?t=1749273403\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.webm?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564090/extras/bd556ea5e1d0eb9b85e3db37c120e1e6.mp4?t=1749273403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Smoke Break! is a lighthearted 3D stealth puzzle game where you play as Applewood \u2014 a living puff of smoke. By breaking machinery, dashing past bakers, and using smoke to grow, you can hunt down the ultimate, yet elusive, burnt pie!",
